    "title": "Independence Hit-and-Run Leaves Man Fighting for Life Near Noland Road - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Clara Lin ,\n1 days ago\nA man was left fighting for his life after a hit-and-run driver struck him and sped off near South Noland Road and East 42nd Street in Independence late Tuesday night. Police were dispatched to the scene just before 11 p.m. following reports of a person in the roadway, and officers arrived to find a male victim who required immediate life-saving measures before he was taken to a local hospital.\nRead full article\nAdd to Preferred Sources",
